{"id":"n43808-1-8","stage":4,"title":"농도 · 浓度","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n43808-1-8-1","ko":"이 주스는 과즙 농도가 너무 낮아.","zh":"这杯果汁的果汁浓度太低了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"주스는","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주스는","audio":"/audio/49e14c71db71d4436572.mp3"}},{"text":"과즙","meaning":"果汁","explanation":"과즙：果汁。","readings":[{"term":"과즙","audio":"/audio/b90ab45006090e5aa983.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21347","senseId":"1","lemma":"과즙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과즙","audio":"/audio/b90ab45006090e5aa983.mp3"}},{"text":"농도가","meaning":"浓度","explanation":"농도：浓度；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"농도","audio":"/audio/0ce17e0442bc231598ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43808","senseId":"1","lemma":"농도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농도가","audio":"/audio/498214f014cfa6ba349d.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"낮아.","meaning":"低，次，差","explanation":"낮다：低，次，差；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"낮다","audio":"/audio/066edc9ea6d8d3424666.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58155","senseId":"3","lemma":"낮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낮아","audio":"/audio/72f55f9eb19b38755f2b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"63db64644799c811","term":"주스","zh":"汁，果汁","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3","entryId":"26899","definition":"压榨水果或蔬菜而成的汁液；或指用它制成的饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b90ab45006090e5a","term":"과즙","zh":"果汁","audio":"/audio/b90ab45006090e5aa983.mp3","entryId":"21347","definition":"从水果中渗出或榨出的液体。","pronunciation":["과ː즙"]},{"id":"0ce17e0442bc2315","term":"농도","zh":"浓度","audio":"/audio/0ce17e0442bc231598ba.mp3","entryId":"43808","definition":"某个成分在气体或液体中的浓稠程度。","pronunciation":["농도"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"066edc9ea6d8d342","term":"낮다","zh":"低，次，差","audio":"/audio/066edc9ea6d8d3424666.mp3","entryId":"58155","definition":"质量、水平或能力、价值等在一般程度之下。","pronunciation":["낟따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c35cd6e5ceab3ee5da80.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n43808-1-8-2","ko":"맞아. 과즙이 적어서 싱겁고 맛이 없어.","zh":"对啊，因为果汁含量少，所以很淡而且没味道。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"과즙이","meaning":"果汁","explanation":"과즙：果汁；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"과즙","audio":"/audio/b90ab45006090e5aa983.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21347","senseId":"1","lemma":"과즙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"과즙이","audio":"/audio/5038d8c52a64c9237993.mp3"}},{"text":"적어서","meaning":"少，小，欠缺","explanation":"적다：少，小，欠缺；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62051","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적어서","audio":"/audio/14b2106c1181bdadab4b.mp3"}},{"text":"싱겁고","meaning":"淡，清淡","explanation":"싱겁다：淡，清淡；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"싱겁다","audio":"/audio/8710536623905dfce5e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16472","senseId":"1","lemma":"싱겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싱겁고","audio":"/audio/40f9970171038c3d09f2.mp3"}},{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛이","audio":"/audio/967e9ccf650ca1244186.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"b90ab45006090e5a","term":"과즙","zh":"果汁","audio":"/audio/b90ab45006090e5aa983.mp3","entryId":"21347","definition":"从水果中渗出或榨出的液体。","pronunciation":["과ː즙"]},{"id":"5f930febe6cd0f79","term":"적다","zh":"少，小，欠缺","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3","entryId":"62051","definition":"数、量或程度等达不到一定的标准。","pronunciation":["적ː따"]},{"id":"8710536623905dfc","term":"싱겁다","zh":"淡，清淡","audio":"/audio/8710536623905dfce5e1.mp3","entryId":"16472","definition":"食物的咸味少。","pronunciation":["싱겁따"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"81556